MODIFICATIONS
=============

Roddy was forked from Rodney at commit a842432 ("Migrate command arg
parsing from hand-rolled loops to flag.FlagSet", 2026-03-12). The
following files have been changed from their original Rodney versions:

  main.go            Extension loading, target activation before capture,
                     crash-avoidance flags, roddy renaming
  main_test.go       Tests for the above; roddy renaming
  help.txt           Documented --extension and the extensions command;
                     roddy renaming
  README.md          Fork notice, migration guide, install instructions,
                     updated badges; roddy renaming
  notes.md           Roddy renaming
  test.sh            Roddy renaming
  go.mod             Module path changed to github.com/goeric/roddy
  .gitignore         Roddy renaming
  .github/workflows/publish.yml
                     Removed PyPI wheel-building and publishing jobs;
                     roddy renaming
  .github/workflows/test.yml
                     Roddy renaming
  notes/**           Roddy renaming in documentation and demos

The following files are new in Roddy and are not part of Rodney:

  extensions.go, extensions_test.go
  chrome_flags.go, chrome_flags_test.go
  capture_test.go
  sw.go, sw_test.go
  notes/gvisor-screenshots/
  skills/roddy/SKILL.md
  .claude-plugin/plugin.json, .claude-plugin/marketplace.json
  NOTICE

Throughout, "rodney" has been renamed to "roddy" — this includes the
binary name, the state directory (~/.rodney/ became ~/.roddy/), and the
RODNEY_HOME environment variable (now RODDY_HOME). Roddy does not read
Rodney's state files.
